                <divLine xml:id="m-422e3820-e966-49b0-8df0-a3e0515f09e1" facs="#m-c6234c17-78c4-47ec-bb75-664a553d26c9" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-e5eeb5a0-9b8d-4eab-b9ce-3ed1ec16998b">
              <lg xml:id="m-391983cc-15d2-4680-9ba2-4ce514edf70d">
                <l xml:id="m-8b844ef7-2202-4420-a8bf-07ef352bde82" facs="#m-b235292b-a018-4666-b5bf-769a9eb5af90" label="text-like">SUNDAY AT PRIME.</l><l xml:id="m-483c265b-26b5-4de2-8055-cfee4f1328fd" facs="#m-33cdc21d-7828-4138-8451-944574a188a3" label="lyrics-like">Páter. Ave. Crédo.</l><l xml:id="m-c07fe6fa-f641-4b4e-b31f-96e7e8985f43" facs="#m-1bf4bd81-ba0d-47b3-94a3-3e71c9f4d14e" label="lyrics-like">v. Déus in adjutórium. p. 263.</l><l xml:id="m-e61e9322-5526-40ec-a686-2da3933a6d1b" facs="#m-e80c6386-c371-4610-ab94-08d3d7c3b6bf" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-e0363b78-2a43-492b-9eb1-c411dce506ec" facs="#m-c9f12382-15f6-437d-9e0f-46e1305008f9" label="text-like">1. Tone for the Ordinary Sundays.</l><l xml:id="m-dc38896a-d6da-4f85-98a1-5c492b30f1f6" facs="#m-080648c6-565f-46ba-b395-b8efa6bee7fd" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-80bfec7d-bb32-4208-be42-083d0fe8aa6c" facs="#m-a79109fb-e59e-4b7a-a830-e7fc634e2a3f" label="lyrics-like">CAM lú-cis órto sídere, Dé-um precémur súpplices,</l><l xml:id="m-8be5f0c6-8185-4027-8ec4-9c0531731621" facs="#m-f41be1d9-f008-411f-bab0-260f706e7ad5" label="lyrics-like">Ut in di-úrnis áctibus, Nos sérvet a nocéntibus.</l><l xml:id="m-868b2d19-fd7f-4f66-a9e6-18189f80b764" facs="#m-859afd7a-772a-4109-a5b8-c6e78c143359" label="text-like">2. Tone for Solemn Feasts.</l><l xml:id="m-48c80179-9251-447b-ac68-1bf92262056f" facs="#m-274e08b5-91cd-4913-80b5-0c8477acf173" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-247cf252-b06a-4942-ae93-9510a0a0c12a" facs="#m-dd73af79-3dd3-4d01-b571-79edfff45ef4" label="lyrics-like">CAM lú-cis órto sí dere, Dé-um precémur súppli¬</l><l xml:id="m-8bd91c99-d4f2-4a10-b407-aa0092075cb7" facs="#m-e7612d28-286f-4d2d-8ce4-35c202bddbca" label="lyrics-like">ces, Ut in di-úrnis ácti-bus,</l><l xml:id="m-08228111-d288-421c-b55c-4c35af52581a" facs="#m-4e098317-8311-42d6-b912-ac9dad1ce2f5" label="lyrics-like">Nos sérvet a no-cén-ti-bus.</l><l xml:id="m-4a140c72-1bf6-4f8e-bd6f-94933200736c" facs="#m-6a9af46e-dd87-410a-9097-7bf5f726fd43" label="lyrics-like">Ut cum dies abscésserit,</l><l xml:id="m-219794c5-b369-44d0-bfc1-64c95c2b24fd" facs="#m-e0220829-79f4-4bbc-af0d-47690fe2f432" label="lyrics-like">Linguam refraénans témperet,</l><l xml:id="m-346443c8-4e2a-4b27-85e9-c3965e8806b9" facs="#m-8fc7da3f-05da-44bb-a0f8-9a6b54617156" label="lyrics-like">Ne litis hórror insonet:</l><l xml:id="m-de798e0f-c963-44ff-8fef-ab53392362d0" facs="#m-1dd9f2cf-677f-4a36-a5c2-81240d441147" label="lyrics-like">Noctémque sors redúxerit,</l><l xml:id="m-db05c024-36a6-469d-8181-6e97094aba49" facs="#m-d862e5cd-b547-4fc6-b71f-7080c6390353" label="lyrics-like">Visum fovéndo cóntegat,</l><l xml:id="m-90f6b706-0a2a-4b79-9c31-43cdd59d68fa" facs="#m-3786cda3-e508-4b3a-b5ab-a163cedfaa61" label="lyrics-like">Múndi per abstinéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-51c8803b-0689-4891-a0a7-578a6e71f964" facs="#m-9b47ac77-7980-4564-ba60-855ad0ede1c7" label="lyrics-like">Ne vanitátes háuriat.</l><l xml:id="m-ef9071c3-956d-45da-970c-ddd5327aa29a" facs="#m-2ea1d547-6d56-49e1-8968-d9652562420c" label="lyrics-like">Ipsi canámus glóriam.</l><l xml:id="m-41b02b7a-f42b-46ad-b67e-e02abf6d8ce0" facs="#m-e95d6034-b4f7-43f3-a269-c8814ac47cb4" label="lyrics-like">Sint púra córdis intima,</l><l xml:id="m-94c97d99-882a-4bc3-9545-27b25fe2b8b9" facs="#m-d22eb829-eab2-4159-9fc4-dde67fdc686e" label="lyrics-like">Déo Pátri sit glória,</l><l xml:id="m-14fc3f71-f5ba-4e7c-9ce8-cac960201702" facs="#m-a82192a3-bd42-48fb-a280-577936d1f64e" label="lyrics-like">Ejúsque sóli Filio,</l><l xml:id="m-ae17d6a5-b675-4673-ac7d-057e44c137cc" facs="#m-8c1a1e8e-d978-4206-8f26-10dc7bb05099" label="lyrics-like">Absistat et vecórdia:</l><l xml:id="m-6eee0cd1-0329-4cca-89e6-53f64f75ff04" facs="#m-226fb15f-6ab4-4c47-ad86-6eeaa3085005" label="lyrics-like">Cárnis térat supérbiam</l><l xml:id="m-827cdf6e-3613-40bc-a382-5608e6226d6c" facs="#m-b7e21471-94f6-4c6f-a4e1-c745d9460213" label="lyrics-like">Cum Spiritu Paráclito,</l><l xml:id="m-0bf72cc3-d16f-47b6-a6dd-c168867ed40c" facs="#m-83bca666-3d93-4f64-a7fb-3a8a7ea7dc8a" label="lyrics-like">Pótus cibique párcitas.</l><l xml:id="m-e130df10-dbd0-4f1d-8e21-ad893b11202e" facs="#m-dcead42e-5b2e-44ad-a3b8-0a92134b2529" label="lyrics-like">1Nunc et per ómne saéculum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-e7dd19d9-cabb-4032-bee7-8e949968733c" facs="#m-571b611f-b558-45ec-a533-1d741045f0ab" label="text-like">The Chant for the Hymn varies according to the Season and the Feasts:</l><l xml:id="m-9b19f3af-be77-473c-b7ac-6ad2cabca57a" facs="#m-dd426d91-ce18-4378-98ec-0df44e07efe1" label="text-like">it is indicated in the Proper.</l><l xml:id="m-f7024c67-bef5-4284-99ba-39c1076ae93e" facs="#m-604d5f88-bc34-4376-b89b-bb8426058b10" label="text-like">During the year.</l><l xml:id="m-bc9f9664-80d7-4902-95ca-fab37aee4c3a" facs="#m-03c64c6e-e675-482b-bb29-fbe4b81130e4" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-8d48baa4-ba2e-4c24-b7ab-d3ecce6634ea" facs="#m-07744229-df5a-48fc-b6c5-bd7cf62d7f54" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-ef3ffb8c-fcfa-4bd2-8726-c957dd811c07" facs="#m-b291f1d2-682a-4af1-b1db-0a9e533f9164" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-9a8e1d26-6010-4525-bd16-d4038d581911" facs="#m-bf36c9ee-8aa8-43c2-b9b8-138e9009e82c" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-12dae516-3f7c-4c53-a6b9-bcdc2c0b9571" facs="#m-63d4151f-80b8-4670-acfb-209f664cccc4" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>